{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は沈金でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回ですが\nフリースタイルラップのコーナーは\nもっと頑張ります..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は職人さんが面白すぎて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/30/8181331/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑い上戸なんですよね...\n笑いを堪える練習をします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと\nたくさんのRNありがとうございます！！\nいくつか覚えてるやつを\n今度挑戦してみますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/30/8181331/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白い事、思いつかないけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/30/8181331/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"SOLIDEMOから\n佐々木 和也さん、木全 寛幸さん、手島 章斗さん\nでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/30/8181331/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん個性強くて\nもっといろいろ知りたいなと思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださってありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/30/8181331/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてくださったみなさん\n代々木来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週も聴いてね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！！今日急遽ですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ライムスター宇多丸のウィークエンド・シャッフル」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に出演させていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/30/8181331/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未とだよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22：00～24：00\nTBSラジオ 「ライムスター宇多丸のウィークエンド・シャッフル」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ始まる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週はANN0もあったし\nラジオな日々です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/30/8181331/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日 発売だった\n『BOMB Love Special 2016』に載ってます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつものBOMBじゃなくて\n別冊のですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛とペアグラビアやっちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/30/8181331/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/30/8181331/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛ちゃんと二人だけって初めて！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣着たり\n部屋着着たり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/30/8181331/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな妹がほしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あともう１つ注目ポイントね\n扇子プレゼントのページ見てほしいの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"琴子と同じタイミングで書いたわけじゃないよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}